    "Everything you posted from here is deleted, your followers and the people you follow are let go, and every server that knew this account is told it is gone. It cannot be undone, and there is no way to get any of it back afterwards — take an archive from the Export button above first if you might want one." : "Scriostar gach rud a phostáil tú as seo, scaoiltear do leantóirí agus na daoine a leanann tú as, agus cuirtear in iúl do gach freastalaí a raibh aithne aige ar an gcuntas seo go bhfuil sé imithe. Ní féidir é a chealú, agus níl aon bhealach ann é a fháil ar ais ina dhiaidh sin - tóg cartlann ón gcnaipe Easpórtála thuas ar dtús má tá ceann uait.",
    "Your Nextcloud account is not touched: you stay signed in to everything else, and you can make a new Social account straight away. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go, so a new account needs a different one." : "Ní dhéantar teagmháil le do chuntas Nextcloud: fanann tú sínithe isteach ar gach rud eile, agus is féidir leat cuntas Sóisialta nua a dhéanamh láithreach. Coinnítear an láimhseáil atá á scriosadh agat ar feadh uair an chloig ionas nach mbeidh aon duine eile in ann é a thógáil nuair a scaoilfidh tú é, agus mar sin tá cuntas eile ag teastáil ó chuntas nua.",
    "A post that already reached somebody else's server is deleted by asking that server to delete it. Almost all of them do; none of them can be made to." : "Scriostar postáil a shroich freastalaí duine éigin eile cheana féin ach iarraidh ar an bhfreastalaí sin é a scriosadh. Déanann beagnach gach ceann acu; ní féidir aon cheann acu a dhéanamh.",
