    "Give the filter a name, so you know what it was for later." : "Tabhair ainm don scagaire, ionas go mbeidh a fhios agat cad a bhí ann ar ball.",
    "One of the words is empty. Fill it in or take the row out — a filter with an empty word would match every post there is." : "Tá ceann de na focail folamh. Líon isteach é nó tóg amach an tsraith - bheadh ​​scagaire le focal folamh ag teacht le gach postáil atá ann.",
