    "New filter" : "Scagaire nua",
    "Editing “{title}”" : "Ag cur “{title}” in eagar",
    "This filter has expired and is not doing anything. Saving it starts it again for as long as the expiry below says." : "Tá an scagaire seo imithe in éag agus níl aon rud á dhéanamh aige. Shábháil sé Tosaíonn sé arís chomh fada agus a deir an dul in éag thíos.",
    "Name of the filter" : "Ainm an scagaire",
    "What you are filtering, in your own words" : "An rud atá á scagadh agat, i d’fhocail féin",
    "Words to look for" : "Focail le lorg",
    "A post is filtered if any one of these appears in it: in the text, in the content warning, in the description of a picture or in the options of a poll. A boost is read as the post it boosts. Upper and lower case never matter." : "Déantar postáil a scagadh má tá aon cheann díobh seo le feiceáil ann: sa téacs, sa rabhadh ábhair, sa chur síos ar phictiúr nó i roghanna vótaíochta. Léirítear treisiú mar an post a threisíonn sé. Ní hionann cás uachtarach agus cás íochtair.",
    "Word or phrase" : "Focal nó frása",
    "Whole word only" : "Focal iomlán amháin",
    "Remove this word" : "Bain an focal seo",
    "“Whole word only” is the difference between filtering “cat” and also filtering every “catalogue”. It is decided for each word on its own." : "Is ionann “focal iomlán amháin” agus an difríocht idir “cat” a scagadh agus gach “catalóg” a scagadh. Déantar cinneadh ar gach focal ina aonar.",
    "Add another word" : "Cuir focal eile leis",
    "Where it applies" : "I gcás ina mbaineann sé",
    "A filter only works in the places you tick. Somewhere you did not tick, a matching post arrives as usual." : "Ní oibríonn scagaire ach sna háiteanna a gcuireann tú tic leo. Áit éigin nár chuir tú tic leis, sroicheann postáil meaitseála mar is gnách.",
    "What happens to a post it matches" : "Cad a tharlaíonn do phostáil a mheaitseálann sé",
    "Fold it away, with a way to read it anyway" : "Fill ar shiúl é, le bealach chun é a léamh ar aon nós",
    "The post keeps its place in the timeline, folded behind the name of this filter, and nothing of it is on the page until you press “Show anyway”. Nothing is kept from you — you are asked whether you want it." : "Coinníonn an postáil a áit san amlíne, fillte taobh thiar d'ainm an scagaire seo, agus níl aon chuid de ar an leathanach go dtí go brúigh tú \"Taispeáin ar aon nós\". Ní choinnítear aon rud uait - iarrtar ort an dteastaíonn uait é.",
    "Take it out of the timeline" : "Tóg amach as an amlíne é",
    "The post is not sent to you at all, here or in any app, and a conversation containing one simply has a gap. Nothing is deleted and nobody is told: lift the filter and the post is back." : "Ní sheoltar an post chugat ar chor ar bith, anseo nó in aon aip, agus níl ach bearna i gcomhrá ina bhfuil ceann. Ní scriostar aon rud agus ní insítear do dhuine ar bith: ardaigh an scagaire agus tá an post ar ais.",
