    "You have no filters. A filter is a word or a phrase you would rather not read: a post carrying it is folded away behind the filter’s name, or taken out of your timelines altogether." : "Níl aon scagairí agat. Is focal nó frása é scagaire nár mhaith leat a léamh: filltear postáil atá á iompar taobh thiar d’ainm an scagaire, nó baintear amach as d’amlínte ar fad.",
