    "_%n filter is taking posts out of what you read._::_%n filters are taking posts out of what you read._" : ["Tá %n scagaire ag baint postálacha as an méid a léigh tú.", "Tá %n scagaire ag baint postálacha as an méid a léigh tú.", "Tá %n scagaire ag baint postálacha as an méid a léigh tú.", "Tá %n scagaire ag baint postálacha as an méid a léigh tú.", "Tá %n scagaire ag baint postálacha as an méid a léigh tú."],
