    "Copy" : "Cóip",
    "Give it to people the way you would an email address. Your profile, your avatar and your name come from your Nextcloud account and can be changed on your profile page." : "Tabhair do dhaoine é mar a dhéanfá seoladh ríomhphoist. Tagann do phróifíl, d’avatar agus d’ainm ó do chuntas Nextcloud agus is féidir iad a athrú ar do leathanach próifíle.",
    "A feed is only as good as who is in it" : "Níl beatha ach chomh maith leis an té atá ann",
    "Nothing shows up here until you follow somebody. Two places to start:" : "Níl aon rud le feiceáil anseo go dtí go leanann tú duine éigin. Dhá áit le tosú:",
    "People on your Nextcloud" : "Daoine ar do Nextcloud",
    "Looking around …" : "Ag breathnú thart…",
    "Nobody on this Nextcloud has said where they are on the fediverse yet. You are the first — your handle is now on your Nextcloud profile, so the next person will see you here." : "Níl sé ráite ag aon duine ar an Nextcloud seo cá bhfuil siad ar an bhfeadóg mhór fós. Is tusa an chéad duine - tá do láimhseáil ar do phróifíl Nextcloud anois, mar sin feicfidh an chéad duine eile anseo thú.",
    "Starter packs" : "Pacáistí tosaitheoir",
    "No starter packs on this server. Discover has suggestions and what is trending." : "Níl aon phacáistí tosaithe ar an bhfreastalaí seo. Tá moltaí ag Discover agus cad atá ag treochtáil.",
    "Already somewhere else?" : "Cheana féin áit éigin eile?",
    "If you have an account on Mastodon or another server, bring the people you follow. Mastodon and servers like it export them as following_accounts.csv, Pixelfed as pixelfed-following.json — upload that file and each one is followed from here." : "Má tá cuntas agat ar Mastodon nó ar fhreastalaí eile, tabhair leat na daoine a leanann tú. Easpórtálann Mastodon agus freastalaithe mar seo iad mar following_accounts.csv, Pixelfed mar pixelfed-following.json — uaslódáil an comhad sin agus leantar gach ceann as seo.",
    "Following …" : "Ina dhiaidh …",
    "Upload your follows" : "Uaslódáil do chuid seo a leanas",
    "On Mastodon: Preferences → Import and export → Data export → Follows (CSV). Moving your followers over as well is in Settings, under Migration — that one is a one-way move, so it is not a button here." : "Ar Mastodon: Roghanna → Iompórtáil agus onnmhairiú → Easpórtáil sonraí → Seo a leanas (CSV). Tá bogadh do lucht leanta anonn freisin i Socruithe, faoi Imirce — is bogadh aontreo é an ceann sin, mar sin ní cnaipe anseo é.",
    "That is all there is to it" : "Is é sin go léir atá ann dó",
    "Your feed fills up as the people you follow post. Meanwhile, say hello — a first post is how the fediverse finds out you are here." : "Líonann do bheatha suas de réir mar a dhéanann na daoine a leanann tú postáil. Idir an dá linn, abair hello - is é an chéad phostáil an chaoi a bhfaigheann an fhealsúnach amach go bhfuil tú anseo.",
    "You have not followed anyone yet, and that is fine: Discover is always a click away in the sidebar. Say hello in the meantime — a first post is how the fediverse finds out you are here." : "Níor lean tú aon duine go fóill, agus tá sé sin ceart go leor: tá Discover i gcónaí cliceáil ar shiúl sa taobhbharra. Abair hello idir an dá linn - is é an chéad phostáil ná an chaoi a bhfaigheann an fhealsúnach amach go bhfuil tú anseo.",
    "Back" : "Ar ais",
    "Next" : "Ar aghaidh",
    "Write your first post" : "Scríobh do chéad phostáil",
