    "About My interests" : "Faoi Mo leasanna",
    "Social now learns which hashtags interest you from how you read, to build your My interests feed. This stays on this server and is only visible to you." : "Foghlaimíonn Social anois cé na haischlibeanna a bhfuil spéis agat iontu ón gcaoi a léann tú, chun do chuid fotha Mo spéiseanna a fhorbairt. Fanann sé seo ar an bhfreastalaí seo agus níl sé le feiceáil ach duitse.",
