    "Learn from my browsing" : "Foghlaim ó mo bhrabhsáil",
    "Which hashtags you linger on, open, like and skip. It stays on this server and nobody but you sees it." : "Cad iad na haischlibeanna a fhanann tú orthu, a osclaíonn, a thaitníonn leat agus a scipeann tú. Fanann sé ar an bhfreastalaí seo agus ní fheiceann duine ar bith ach tú é.",
    "Pause learning" : "Cuir an fhoghlaim ar sos",
    "For a day of reading something unusual. My interests keeps working with what it knows, and nothing new is learned or forgotten until you switch this back." : "Ar feadh lae léitheoireachta rud éigin neamhghnách. Fanann mo chuid spéise ag obair lena bhfuil ar eolas aige, agus ní fhoghlaimítear nó ní dhéantar dearmad ar aon rud nua go dtí go n-aistríonn tú é seo ar ais.",
    "Learning is off, so this list is frozen and My interests is hidden. You can still change it, and it is all here when you turn learning back on." : "Tá an fhoghlaim múchta, mar sin tá an liosta seo reoite agus tá Mo spéiseanna i bhfolach. Is féidir leat é a athrú go fóill, agus tá sé ar fad anseo nuair a chuireann tú an fhoghlaim ar siúl arís.",
    "Still learning what you like. Until it knows more, My interests also shows hashtags you follow and what is trending here." : "Fós ag foghlaim cad is maith leat. Go dtí go mbeidh a fhios aige níos mó, léiríonn mo leasanna freisin hashtags a leanann tú agus cad atá ag treochtáil anseo.",
    "Hashtag to add to your interests" : "Hashtag chun cur le do spéiseanna",
