    "Add #{tag} to your interests" : "Cuir #{tag} le do spéiseanna",
    "Languages for My interests" : "Teangacha do mo spéiseanna",
    "All languages" : "Gach teanga",
    "Only posts in these languages. None chosen means every language." : "Postálacha sna teangacha seo amháin. Ciallaíonn aon duine a roghnaítear gach teanga.",
    "Forgets everything learned, and the hashtags you added, placed and pinned. Hashtags you follow stay followed." : "Déanann sé dearmad ar gach rud a foghlaimíodh, agus ar na hashtags a chuir tú leis, a chuir tú agus a phinn tú. Fanann na haischlibeanna a leanann tú ina dhiaidh.",
    "Reset all interests?" : "Athshocraigh gach leas?",
    "Everything Social has learned about what you like goes, with the hashtags you added and the order you gave them. It starts learning again from nothing. This cannot be undone." : "Téann gach rud atá foghlamtha ag Social faoi cad is maith leat, leis na hashtags a chuir tú leis agus leis an ord a thug tú dóibh. Tosaíonn sé ag foghlaim arís ó rud ar bith. Ní féidir é seo a chealú.",
    "_Show %n more candidate_::_Show %n more candidates_" : ["Taispeáin %n iarrthóir eile", "Taispeáin %n iarrthóir eile", "Taispeáin %n iarrthóir eile", "Taispeáin %n iarrthóir eile", "Taispeáin %n iarrthóir eile"],
    "Show the introduction again" : "Taispeáin an réamhrá arís",
    "Could not load your lists" : "Níorbh fhéidir do liostaí a lódáil",
    "You can only add people you follow to a list" : "Ní féidir leat ach na daoine a leanann tú a chur le liosta",
    "Could not change the list" : "Níorbh fhéidir an liosta a athrú",
    "Lists with {account}" : "Liostaí le {account}",
    "Loading your lists …" : "Ag lódáil do liostaí …",
    "You have no lists yet. Make one under Settings, then come back here to put people in it." : "Níl aon liostaí agat fós. Déan ceann faoi Socruithe, ansin tar ar ais anseo chun daoine a chur ann.",
    "Tick a list to put them in it. Lists your Nextcloud groups give you are not here: the group decides who is in those." : "Cuir tic le liosta chun iad a chur ann. Liostaíonn do ghrúpaí Nextcloud nach bhfuil tú anseo: cinneann an grúpa cé atá iontu.",
