    "New list" : "Liosta nua",
    "Create" : "Cruthaigh",
    "You have no lists yet. A list is a few of the people you follow, read as a timeline of their own." : "Níl aon liostaí agat fós. Is éard atá i liosta ná roinnt de na daoine a leanann tú, a léamh mar amlíne dá gcuid féin.",
