    "Remove {account} from the list" : "Bain {account} den liosta",
    "Add somebody you follow" : "Cuir duine éigin a leanann tú leis",
    "Name or @handle" : "Ainm nó @handle",
    "Nobody by that name." : "Aon duine faoin ainm sin.",
    "Who is in this list follows the “{group}” group in Nextcloud. Add or remove people there and this list follows." : "Leanann an té atá ar an liosta seo an grúpa “{group}” in Nextcloud. Cuir leis nó bain daoine ann agus seo a leanas an liosta seo.",
    "Delete the list {list}?" : "Scrios an liosta {list}?",
    "The list goes, and so does its timeline. Nobody is unfollowed: the people in it are only taken out of the list." : "Téann an liosta, agus mar sin déanann a amlíne. Níl aon duine gan leanúint: ní dhéantar na daoine atá ann ach a bhaint as an liosta.",
