    "This decides what happens from now on. It does not take back a quote somebody has already posted — use the list below for that." : "Socraíonn sé seo cad a tharlóidh as seo amach. Ní thógann sé luachan a chuir duine éigin ar ais cheana féin - bain úsáid as an liosta thíos le haghaidh sin.",
    "Who has quoted it" : "Cé a luaigh é",
    "Nobody has quoted this post." : "Níor luaigh éinne an postáil seo.",
    "Detach this quote" : "Dícheangail an luachan seo",
    "Detaching tells the other server, which then shows the quote as withdrawn. The post itself is theirs and stays where it is." : "Detaching insíonn an freastalaí eile, a thaispeánann ansin an ceanglófar mar a tarraingíodh siar. Is leo féin an post agus fanann sé san áit a bhfuil sé.",
    "This quote is waiting for the quoted author to approve it." : "Tá an luachan seo ag fanacht leis an údar luaite a cheadú.",
    "The author of the quoted post did not allow this quote." : "Níor cheadaigh údar an phoist luaite an luachan seo.",
    "The author of the quoted post withdrew their permission for this quote." : "Tharraing údar an phoist luaite a gcead don luachan seo siar.",
    "The quoted post is not available." : "Níl an post luaite ar fáil.",
    "The quoted post quotes another post." : "Luaitear postáil eile sa phostáil luaite.",
    "Open the quoted post" : "Oscail an post luaite",
    "Choose a reaction" : "Roghnaigh imoibriú",
    "Choose an emoji" : "Roghnaigh emoji",
    "Show me how my week went" : "Taispeáin dom conas a chuaigh mo sheachtain",
    "A line at the top of your feed, once a week, saying how many times you posted. Nobody else sees it, and there is no streak to keep up." : "Líne ag barr do bheatha, uair sa tseachtain, ag rá cé mhéad uair a phostáil tú. Ní fheiceann aon duine eile é, agus níl aon stríoc ann le coinneáil suas.",
    "Change the time of this scheduled post" : "Athraigh am an phoist sceidealaithe seo",
    "Change time" : "Athraigh am",
    "Cancel this scheduled post" : "Cealaigh an postáil sceidealta seo",
    "Nothing is waiting to be posted. The clock in the composer schedules a post for later." : "Níl aon rud ag fanacht le postáil. Déanann an clog sa chumadóir postáil a sceidealú le haghaidh níos déanaí.",
    "Search results for “{term}”" : "Torthaí cuardaigh le haghaidh “{term}”",
    "Searching …" : "Ag cuardach …",
    "Nothing on this server matches “{term}”. Searching for a full handle like @user@example.org can find somebody this server has not met yet." : "Ní mheaitseálann aon rud ar an bhfreastalaí seo “{term}”. Má chuardaítear hanla iomlán ar nós @user@example.org is féidir teacht ar dhuine nár bhuail an freastalaí seo le chéile fós.",
    "People" : "Daoine",
    "Hashtags" : "Hashtags",
    "Posts" : "Poist",
    "Play sounds" : "Fuaimeanna a imirt",
    "Listen" : "Éist",
    "A soft tick when you like something, a breath of air when a post goes out, and a two-note chime when a direct message arrives. Off until you turn it on." : "Cuir tic bog nuair is maith leat rud éigin, anáil aeir nuair a théann cuaille amach, agus clingín dhá nóta nuair a thagann teachtaireacht dhíreach. As go dtí go gcuirfidh tú ar siúl é.",
    "Vibrate" : "Creathadh",
    "A short tap in the hand on a phone when you like, boost, react or post. Your system setting for less motion turns it off as well." : "Tapáil gearr sa lámh ar ghuthán nuair is mian leat, nuair is mian leat, treisiú, freagairt nó postáil. Casann do shocrú córais le haghaidh níos lú gluaisne as é freisin.",
    "Mastodon apps cannot connect to this server" : "Ní féidir le haipeanna Mastodon ceangal leis an bhfreastalaí seo",
    "The web server has to map /api, /oauth and two /.well-known paths onto Social. It has to do that as an internal proxy and not as a redirect: Nextcloud routes on the address a request arrived at, so a plain rewrite answers 404, and many clients drop their authorization when they follow a redirect. Inside the Apache virtual host that serves Nextcloud:" : "Caithfidh an freastalaí gréasáin /api, /oauth agus dhá /. cosán a bhfuil aithne mhaith orthu a mhapáil chuig Social. Caithfidh sé é sin a dhéanamh mar sheachvótálaí inmheánach agus ní mar atreorú: bealaí Nextcloud ar an seoladh a tháinig an t-iarratas, mar sin freagraíonn athscríobh simplí 404, agus scaoileann go leor cliant a n-údarú nuair a leanann siad atreorú. Laistigh den ósta fíorúil Apache a fhreastalaíonn ar Nextcloud:",
    "Whatever the rules proxy to has to serve this Nextcloud itself. A host or port that serves a different document root — one with no virtual host for this domain, say — answers 404 for every proxied request, which looks exactly like having no rules at all. An Apache 404 page names the port it came from, which tells the two apart." : "Cibé seachfhreastalaí rialacha a chaithfidh sé freastal ar an Nextcloud seo féin. Freagraíonn óstach nó port a fhreastalaíonn ar fhréamh doiciméad difriúil - ceann gan óstach fíorúil don fhearann ​​seo, abair - 404 do gach iarratas seachfhreastalaí, a bhfuil an chuma air go díreach nach bhfuil aon rialacha ann. Ainmníonn leathanach Apache 404 an port as ar tháinig sé, a insíonn an dá rud óna chéile.",
    "The rules for nginx, what each one is for, and what else changes once requests arrive through a proxy are in the documentation. Nothing else is affected: the web interface and federation with other servers work without any of this." : "Tá na rialacha maidir le nginx, cad chuige a bhfuil gach ceann acu, agus cad eile a athraíonn a luaithe a thagann iarratais trí sheachvótálaí sa doiciméadú. Ní dhéantar difear do rud ar bith eile: oibríonn an comhéadan gréasáin agus an chónaidhm le freastalaithe eile gan aon cheann de seo.",
    "Social is set up for a different address than this server" : "Socraítear Social le seoladh eile seachas an freastalaí seo",
    "Changing it renames every account and post that already exists here, so Social will not do it on its own. Either point the server back at the address Social knows, or reset Social with \"occ social:reset\" — which deletes everything it holds." : "Athainmníonn sé gach cuntas agus post atá ann cheana féin anseo, agus mar sin ní dhéanfaidh Social é leis féin. Cuir an freastalaí ar ais chuig an seoladh atá ar eolas ag Social, nó athshocraigh Social le \"occ social:reset\" - a scriosann gach rud atá aige.",
