    "What the people on this server have been writing. Posts that arrived from elsewhere are not counted: those are a number about other servers and about how long this one keeps what they send." : "Cad a bhí á scríobh ag na daoine ar an bhfreastalaí seo. Ní chomhairtear poist a tháinig ó áiteanna eile: is uimhir iad sin faoi fhreastalaithe eile agus faoi cé chomh fada agus a choinníonn an ceann seo an méid a sheolann siad.",
