    "Follow everyone" : "Lean gach duine",
    "Their server did not answer. That is often a passing rate limit — and permanent if this Nextcloud cannot be reached from the internet, because a server that only answers signed requests has to fetch this one’s key to check the signature." : "Níor fhreagair a bhfreastalaí. Is minic gurb é sin teorainn ráta a rith - agus buan mura féidir an Nextcloud seo a bhaint amach ón idirlíon, toisc go gcaithfidh freastalaí nach bhfreagraíonn ach iarratais sínithe eochair an cheann seo a fháil chun an síniú a sheiceáil.",
    "No starter packs" : "Uimh pacáistí tosaithe",
    "An administrator can add some with the starter_packs app setting." : "Is féidir le riarthóir roinnt a chur leis an socrú app starter_packs.",
    "Search the fediverse" : "Cuardaigh an fealsamh",
    "Any name or handle, on any server — including servers this one has never met. A full handle like @someone@example.org finds a person anywhere." : "Aon ainm nó láimhseáil, ar aon fhreastalaí - lena n-áirítear freastalaithe nár bhuail an ceann seo riamh. Aimsíonn láimhseáil iomlán mar @someone@example.org duine áit ar bith.",
    "Because of who you follow" : "Mar gheall ar a leanann tú",
    "The people you follow follow other people. This asks their servers who, and puts the ones several of them share first." : "Leanann na daoine a leanann tú daoine eile. Iarrann sé seo ar a gcuid freastalaithe cé hiad, agus cuireann sé na cinn a roinneann go leor acu ar dtús.",
    "People this server knows" : "Daoine a bhfuil aithne ag an bhfreastalaí seo orthu",
