    "Posts from accounts you follow, including private posts you are allowed to see." : "Postálacha ó chuntais a leanann tú, lena n-áirítear postálacha príobháideacha a bhfuil cead agat a fheiceáil.",
    "Public posts from this Nextcloud server." : "Postálacha poiblí ón bhfreastalaí Nextcloud seo.",
    "Public posts from across the Fediverse." : "Poist phoiblí ó ar fud na Fediverse.",
    "Loading posts…" : "postálacha á lódáil…",
    "Could not load this feed" : "Níorbh fhéidir an fotha seo a lódáil",
    "When somebody names them in a photo, it shows up here." : "Nuair a ainmníonn duine iad i ngrianghraf, taispeánann sé anseo.",
    "Could not load these photos" : "Níorbh fhéidir na grianghraif seo a lódáil",
    "No photos of them" : "Uimh grianghraif díobh",
    "How others find you, and who sees what you post." : "Conas a fhaigheann daoine eile tú, agus cé a fheiceann cad a phostálann tú.",
    "Featured hashtags" : "Hashtags faoi thrácht",
    "The hashtags you want your profile to be known for. They sit under your bio, and anybody can click one to read what you posted with it." : "Na haischlibeanna ar mian leat go mbeadh aithne ag do phróifíl orthu. Suíonn siad faoi do bheathaisnéis, agus is féidir le duine ar bith cliceáil ar cheann amháin chun an méid a chuir tú suas leis a léamh.",
    "The hashtags Social has noticed you reading, the biggest first. They make up your My interests feed: drag one to change its place, pin it, remove it, or add your own. Nobody but you sees this." : "Thug na hashtags Social faoi deara tú ag léamh, an chéad cheann is mó. Is iad na fotha Mo leasanna atá agat: tarraing ceann chun a áit a athrú, bioráin é, bain é nó cuir do chuid féin leis. Ní fheiceann aon duine ach tú é seo.",
    "A list is a few of the people you follow, read as a timeline of its own. Your lists are in the sidebar." : "Is éard atá i liosta ná roinnt de na daoine a leanann tú, a léamh mar amlíne dá chuid féin. Tá do liostaí sa bharra taoibh.",
    "Scheduled posts" : "Poist sceidealta",
    "What you have written to be published later. Move one to another time or cancel it here." : "An méid atá scríofa agat le foilsiú níos déanaí. Bog duine go chéile nó cuir ar ceal é anseo.",
    "Portfolio" : "Punann",
    "A page of your work with its own address, to put on a CV. A profile is a feed — everything you posted, newest first, with the follow button and the boosts around it. This is the opposite: a title, a sentence, the pictures you chose, and nothing else. Anybody can read it without signing in, so only your public photos are ever on it." : "Leathanach de do chuid oibre lena sheoladh féin, le cur ar CV. Is éard atá i bpróifíl fotha - gach rud a phostáil tú, an ceann is nuaí ar dtús, leis an gcnaipe leantach agus na teanntáin timpeall air. Is é seo a mhalairt: teideal, abairt, na pictiúir a roghnaigh tú, agus rud ar bith eile. Is féidir le duine ar bith é a léamh gan síniú isteach, mar sin níl ach do ghrianghraif phoiblí air riamh.",
    "Archived posts" : "Postálacha cartlainne",
    "Posts you have put away. They are off your profile and out of every timeline here, and nobody was told — an archived post is still on the servers that received it, which is what deleting is for. Put one back whenever you like." : "Poist a chuir tú uait. Tá siad as do phróifíl agus as gach amlíne anseo, agus níor dúradh le duine ar bith - tá postáil i gcartlann fós ar na freastalaithe a fuair é, agus is é sin an cuspóir atá le scriosadh. Cuir ceann ar ais aon uair is mian leat.",
    "Waiting to be looked at" : "Ag fanacht le breathnú ar",
    "Some posts are kept for a moderator to see before they go out — the first post of a new account, and posts that tripped one of this server's spam rules. Yours are here until somebody looks at them. You can take one back; nobody is told if you do." : "Coinnítear roinnt postálacha le go bhfeicfeadh modhnóir iad sula dtéann siad amach — an chéad phostáil de chuntas nua, agus postálacha a thuisligh ceann de rialacha turscair an fhreastalaí seo. Tá mise anseo go dtí go bhféachann duine éigin orthu. Is féidir leat ceann a thógáil ar ais; ní insítear do dhuine ar bith má dhéanann tú.",
    "Looking back" : "Ag breathnú siar",
    "Posts you wrote on this day in earlier years appear at the top of your feed on their own. This is the other half: a note about the week just gone, if you want one." : "Tá na poist a scríobh tú ar an lá seo le blianta beaga anuas le feiceáil ag barr do chuid fotha ina n-aonar. Seo an leath eile: nóta faoin tseachtain díreach imithe, más mian leat ceann.",
    "Sound and touch" : "Fuaim agus teagmháil",
    "Small confirmations you hear or feel. They are kept on this device only, so a laptop at work can stay quiet while your phone taps back." : "Deimhnithe beaga a chloiseann tú nó a bhraitheann tú. Coinnítear iad ar an ngléas seo amháin, mar sin is féidir le ríomhaire glúine ag an obair fanacht ciúin agus do ghuthán ag tapáil ar ais.",
    "Authorized apps" : "Aipeanna údaraithe",
    "The apps you have signed in to with this account — a phone client, a cross-poster, anything that asked. Each one holds a key to your account until you take it back, so this is the page to open after losing a phone." : "Na haipeanna ar shínigh tú isteach leo leis an gcuntas seo — cliant gutháin, trasphóstaer, rud ar bith a d’iarr tú. Coinníonn gach ceann acu eochair do do chuntas go dtí go dtógfaidh tú ar ais é, mar sin is é seo an leathanach le hoscailt tar éis do ghuthán a chailleadh.",
    "Introduction" : "Réamhrá",
    "The four steps shown when your account was new: your address, people to follow, and the follows you had on another server." : "Na ceithre chéim a léiríodh nuair a bhí do chuntas nua: do sheoladh, daoine le leanúint, agus na céimeanna seo a leanas a bhí agat ar fhreastalaí eile.",
    "The keys this app listens for while you are reading." : "Na heochracha a n-éisteann an aip seo leo agus tú ag léamh.",
    "Delete your Social account" : "Scrios do chuntas Sóisialta",
    "Your fediverse account, gone, while your Nextcloud account stays exactly as it is. Last, and on its own, because it is the one thing on this page that cannot be undone." : "Do chuntas ilchineálach, imithe, agus fanann do chuntas Nextcloud díreach mar atá sé. Ar deireadh, agus leis féin, toisc gurb é an rud amháin ar an leathanach seo nach féidir a chealú.",
    "Everything this app keeps about you and the way you use it. Nothing here changes until you change it." : "Gach rud a choimeádann an aip seo fút agus an bealach a úsáideann tú é. Ní athraíonn aon rud anseo go dtí go n-athraíonn tú é.",
    "All time" : "An t-am ar fad",
