    "Not enough posts at any one hour to say yet — it takes three in the same hour before this is more than luck." : "Níl go leor post ag aon uair an chloig le rá go fóill - tógann sé trí cinn san uair chéanna sula mbíonn níos mó ná ádh ort.",
