    "A step in this line is usually the survey reaching servers it had not reached before, rather than the network changing size — so no year-on-year figure is shown for a year that has one in it." : "Céim sa líne seo de ghnáth is ea an suirbhé a shroicheann freastalaithe nár shroich sé roimhe seo, seachas an líonra a athrú méide — mar sin ní léirítear figiúr bliain ar bhliain do bhliain a bhfuil ceann ann.",
    "What you did" : "Cad a rinne tú",
