    "_picture posted_::_pictures posted_" : ["pictiúr postáilte", "pictiúir postáilte", "pictiúir postáilte", "pictiúir postáilte", "pictiúir postáilte"],
    "Settings → Your account → Download an archive of your data, and wait for the mail. Your posts and their pictures are in it. The accounts you followed are in it only as numbers, so there is nobody in that file to look up — and nothing on X federates, so no follower can come with you." : "Socruithe → Do chuntas → Íoslódáil cartlann de do shonraí, agus fan leis an ríomhphost. Tá do phoist agus a bpictiúir ann. Níl sna cuntais a lean tú ach mar uimhreacha, agus mar sin níl aon duine sa chomhad sin le breathnú suas - agus níl aon rud ar X cónaidhmeanna, mar sin ní féidir le haon leantóir teacht leat.",
    "Settings → Accounts Centre → Your information and permissions → Download your information, and choose JSON. The HTML download holds the pages and not the posts. Your posts, your reels and the list of accounts you follow are all in that one file." : "Socruithe → Lárionad na gCuntas → Do chuid faisnéise agus ceadanna → Íoslódáil do chuid faisnéise, agus roghnaigh JSON. Coinníonn an íoslódáil HTML na leathanaigh agus ní na postálacha. Tá do phoist, do ríleanna agus liosta na gcuntas a leanann tú ar fad san aon chomhad amháin sin.",
    "Settings → Account → Download your data. The archive holds your videos as files rather than as posts, so there is nothing here that can read it as a timeline yet." : "scduimj.tk → Íosluchtaigh do chuid sonraí. Coinníonn an chartlann do chuid físeáin mar chomhaid seachas mar phoist, mar sin níl aon rud anseo is féidir é a léamh mar amlíne go fóill.",
    "TikTok posts cannot be imported from the archive yet. A video at a time can still be brought over by its address from Settings → Moving in, and everything below this step works the same." : "Ní féidir postálacha TikTok a iompórtáil ón gcartlann go fóill. Is féidir físeán ag an am a thabhairt anonn go fóill trína sheoladh ó Socruithe → Ag bogadh isteach, agus oibríonn gach rud faoi bhun na céime seo mar an gcéanna.",
    "Google Takeout → YouTube and YouTube Music. The archive holds your videos as files rather than as posts, so there is nothing here that can read it as a timeline yet." : "Google Takeout → YouTube agus YouTube Music. Coinníonn an chartlann do chuid físeáin mar chomhaid seachas mar phoist, mar sin níl aon rud anseo is féidir é a léamh mar amlíne go fóill.",
    "Your own uploads are yours to re-publish rather than something to import in bulk — they are whole videos, and each one belongs on a post you write." : "Is leatsa do chuid uaslódála féin le hathfhoilsiú seachas rud éigin le hiompórtáil ar an mórchóir - is físeáin iomlána iad, agus baineann gach ceann díobh le postáil a scríobhann tú.",
    "_Brought over %n post._::_Brought over %n posts._" : ["Tugadh %n postáil anonn.", "Tugadh thar %n postáil.", "Tugadh thar %n postáil.", "Tugadh thar %n postáil.", "Tugadh thar %n postáil."],
    "There are more: run it again to carry on." : "Tá níos mó ann: rith arís é chun leanúint ar aghaidh.",
