    "That archive lists nobody to look up" : "Ní liostaíonn an chartlann sin aon duine le breathnú suas",
    "Could not look those names up" : "Níorbh fhéidir na hainmneacha sin a chuardach",
    "Could not follow those accounts" : "Níorbh fhéidir na cuntais sin a leanúint",
    "I have moved to the fediverse" : "Tá mé tar éis bogadh go dtí an feidiúnach",
