    "Move in from somewhere else" : "Bog isteach ó áit éigin eile",
    "Your posts, the people you follow and a way to tell everyone where you went. Nothing here is posted for you, and nothing leaves this server except the lookups you ask for." : "Do phoist, na daoine a leanann tú agus bealach chun a insint do gach duine cá ndeachaigh tú. Ní chuirtear aon rud anseo ar do shon, agus ní fhágann aon rud an freastalaí seo ach amháin na cuardaigh a iarrann tú.",
