    "Choose your archive" : "Roghnaigh do chartlann",
    "Your posts are written here with the dates they were written on, and nothing is sent to anyone: importing cannot put years of old posts into other people's timelines." : "Tá do phoist scríofa anseo leis na dátaí ar scríobhadh iad, agus ní sheoltar aon rud chuig aon duine: ní féidir le hiompórtáil blianta de sheanphoist a chur isteach in amlínte daoine eile.",
    "Find the people you followed" : "Faigh na daoine a lean tú",
    "Instagram names are Threads names, and Threads is part of the fediverse — so the accounts you already followed can be looked up here, one at a time, from the same archive. Everyone who answers is shown; nobody is followed until you say so." : "Is ainmneacha Snáitheanna iad ainmneacha Instagram, agus tá Threads mar chuid den fhealsúnacht - mar sin is féidir breathnú ar na cuntais a lean tú cheana féin anseo, ceann ag an am, ón gcartlann chéanna. Taispeántar gach duine a fhreagraíonn; ní leantar éinne go dtí go ndeir tú amhlaidh.",
